   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{860F}{94A5}「あっ！お前はスカイシャークの{8207}ブラックリストにのっている{9400}！」{8300}{860F}{94A5}「ここはゼッタイにとおさんぞ！！」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{860F}{94A5}Ah! You're {9400}, the one on Sky Shark's blacklist!{8300}{860F}{94A5}There's no way I'm letting you through here!!{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
   "id": "ev232FC2_020",
   "idx": [
    20
   ],
   "jp": "{8002}{860F}{94A5}「おぅっ！！{8207}もうコウタイの時間か・・・」{8300}{860F}{94A5}「じゃあオレはもどらせてもらうぜ！」{8300}{861F}{94A5}「・・・そういや、つるぎをさす場所を{8207}まちがえないようにしねえと・・・」{8300}{860F}{94A5}「たしか、つるぎを{8833}さか立ちして見る{8800}と{8207}さす場所がわかるんだったな」{8400}{8100}",
   "en": "{8002}{860F}{94A5}Oh!! Is it shift change already...?{8300}{860F}{94A5}Then I'll be heading back!{8300}{861F}{94A5}...Come to think of it, I'd better not put the sword in the wrong spot...{8300}{860F}{94A5}Right, if you {8833}look at the sword while standing on your head{8800}, you can tell where it goes.{8400}{8100}",
   "status": "translated"
  },
  {
